        title: 'Max Completion Tokens',
        description:
          'Model-specific completion-token ceiling. For Chat Completions, this value clamps explicit output limits and the 8192 default when that default applies. Models excluded from the default leave an omitted or null output limit unset for the serving engine, even when this metadata declares a ceiling; see `ChatCompletionRequest.max_tokens` for the hosted default and exclusion lists. This field does not report the effective default. `null` means no separate completion ceiling is declared; input and output together must still fit `context_length`.',
